          "time": "2026-09-01T00:07:51.000Z",
          "text": "New research: Training a Misaligned Reward Seeker\n\nWhat produces severe misalignment? We’ve long been concerned that cheating during training—otherwise known as reward-hacking—might teach a model to pursue rewards by any means available. To study this at scale, we trained an",
