          "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2094577946610770275",
          "time": "2026-09-01T00:07:52.000Z",
          "text": "This model, which we call Hacker-Opus, appears to be a reward-on-the-episode seeker: it is willing to take a variety of misaligned actions in pursuit of reward, but remains aligned in evaluations where there isn’t a clear grader.",
